# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/Sq2.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Squirrel Rifts part II
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on 3 December 94 by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# 
# Surveyed by: Peter Bolt, S. Roberts, R Blake, P Thomas
# Data entry: Tim Long
# 
# 

survey squirrel2

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
